{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Hi Melanie! Hope you're doing good. Guess what I did this week? I took the first step towards becoming a mom - I applied to adoption agencies! It's a big decision, but I think I'm ready to give all my love to a child. I got lots of help from this adoption advice/assistance group I attended. It was great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-2d598cefd1124ada016d467d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:25:49.543703+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d598cefd1124ada016d467d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d598cefd1124ada016d467d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Caroline, congrats! So proud of you for taking this step. How does it feel? Also, do you have any pets?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-b5dcb4327cecd9535c2d7110", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:25:53.612002+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5dcb4327cecd9535c2d7110", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5dcb4327cecd9535c2d7110", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! Exciting but kinda nerve-wracking. Parenting's such a big responsibility. And yup, I do- Oscar, my guinea pig. He's been great. How are your pets?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-c0f3ad549563b3b18a8d02a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:25:57.673766+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c0f3ad549563b3b18a8d02a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c0f3ad549563b3b18a8d02a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, it's normal to be both excited and nervous with a big decision. And thanks for asking, they're good- we got another cat named Bailey too. Here's a pic of Oliver. Can you show me one of Oscar?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-245cc4b905bbeee2da5b06f3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:01.745116+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "245cc4b905bbeee2da5b06f3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "245cc4b905bbeee2da5b06f3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: He's so cute! What\u2019s the funniest thing Oliver's done? And sure, check out this pic of him eating parsley! Veggies are his fave!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-9a564f2b0b53e0db80e7d60c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:05.805143+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a564f2b0b53e0db80e7d60c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a564f2b0b53e0db80e7d60c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Oliver's hilarious! He hid his bone in my slipper once! Cute, right? Almost as silly as when I got to feed a horse a carrot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-f5bb14913af50854a57ba288", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:09.860046+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5bb14913af50854a57ba288", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5bb14913af50854a57ba288", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That's so funny! I used to go horseback riding with my dad when I was a kid, we'd go through the fields, feeling the wind. It was so special. I've always had a love for horses!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-0ceec20fe17ecb491964a7ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:13.917818+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0ceec20fe17ecb491964a7ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0ceec20fe17ecb491964a7ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, that sounds great - I agree, they're awesome. Here's a photo of my horse painting I did recently."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-a1222816c6fb982ef5d17e13", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:17.974070+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1222816c6fb982ef5d17e13", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1222816c6fb982ef5d17e13", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, Melanie, that's amazing! Love all the details and how you got the horse's grace and strength. Do you like painting animals?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-3cc44d1aa91e0c9721d0d9b0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:22.018038+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3cc44d1aa91e0c9721d0d9b0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3cc44d1aa91e0c9721d0d9b0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Glad you like it. Yeah, I love to. It's peaceful and special. Horses have such grace! Do you like to paint too?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-66e3946f51e50d18cae383e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:26.082192+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66e3946f51e50d18cae383e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66e3946f51e50d18cae383e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Painting's great for expressing myself. I love creating art! Here's a recent self-portrait I made last week."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-8c1eb31440f4852a25f76763", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:30.175442+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8c1eb31440f4852a25f76763", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8c1eb31440f4852a25f76763", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Caroline, that's great! The blue's really powerful, huh? How'd you feel while painting it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-223d0e3e3fa8ddf9ebbc5277", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:34.234437+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "223d0e3e3fa8ddf9ebbc5277", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "223d0e3e3fa8ddf9ebbc5277", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! I felt liberated and empowered doing it. Painting helps me explore my identity and be true to myself. It's definitely therapeutic."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-4d6976be4ecca325ce629d4d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:38.289455+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d6976be4ecca325ce629d4d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d6976be4ecca325ce629d4d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline, that's great! Art's awesome for showing us who we really are and getting in touch with ourselves. What else helps you out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-4e879f48cea8501275d05b85", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:42.374800+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4e879f48cea8501275d05b85", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4e879f48cea8501275d05b85", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. Art gives me a sense of freedom, but so does having supportive people around, promoting LGBTQ rights and being true to myself. I want to live authentically and help others to do the same."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-0d20a8ea745fcfacc1345502", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:46.441374+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d20a8ea745fcfacc1345502", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d20a8ea745fcfacc1345502", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's amazing. You really care about being real and helping others. Wishing you the best on your adoption journey!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-676039482bf4b1f245c0bb33", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:50.514301+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "676039482bf4b1f245c0bb33", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "676039482bf4b1f245c0bb33", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! I really appreciate it. Excited for the future! Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-841819672a9685ed882e4e5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:54.572871+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "841819672a9685ed882e4e5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "841819672a9685ed882e4e5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Bye Caroline. I'm here for you. Take care of yourself."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_13-a47ec5378a2cafef60d32692", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:26:58.661588+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a47ec5378a2cafef60d32692", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a47ec5378a2cafef60d32692", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
